From 11a879a31dd6ec4443654b272c8ddb08f6b517d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LGA1150 <9155358+LGA1150@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:24:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] crypto: eip93 - measure skcipher preparation and descriptor
 costs

Add default-off aggregate profiling for requests reaching the skcipher
submission worker. Separate legacy and CTR-SG paths and encrypt/decrypt
directions, count original SG entries, descriptors, hardware/software
bytes and private buffers, and time ID allocation, preparation,
planning, mapping, submission and completion.

Record the last publication timestamp before ringing the doorbell so an
immediate completion cannot race instrumentation updates. Finish samples
before invoking the caller, support all-software CTR completion and
preparation errors, and discard older in-flight samples after a
generation-based reset. Timings are elapsed nanoseconds, not CPU or
accelerator busy time.

Signed-off-by: LGA1150 <9155358+LGA1150@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 Makefile        |   1 +
 eip93-cipher.c  |  13 +++++-
 eip93-cipher.h  |   7 +++
 eip93-common.c  |  92 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 eip93-profile.c | 115 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 eip93-profile.h |  96 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 310 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 eip93-profile.c
 create mode 100644 eip93-profile.h

diff --git a/Makefile b/Makefile
